    "detailed_description": "\u0421reators of RV (Real Virtuality) City introduce to you their new project: RV Kingdom 0x0297.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520130/extras/f742fa4bc0c432de6df661492ad62025.poster.avif?t=1713085008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520130/extras/f742fa4bc0c432de6df661492ad62025.webm?t=1713085008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br><br>Hard times have come upon the continent. While fight for power between factions is reaching its peak, the war seems inevitable. A rumor about the end of times - the demon invasion - starts to spread among people. Will you withstand against the evil or join it?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><u>One story From 15 Different Visions</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520130/extras/44545cc75ecb961ae4676150f7e26658.avif?t=1713085008\" /></span><br><br>Choose one of 15 available classes, ranging from simple merchant to necromancer, all of which have unique gameplay and story!<br><br><u>Mind-Blowing \u0421utting-Edge Combat System</u><br><br>Huge variety of abilities, status effects, damage types and other features make a complex battle system that can surprise you with its seemingly endless possibilities and quirky situations!<br><br>You will take part in many fun battles on 8x8 grid with your own assembled party or solo!<br><br><u>Adventures and Exploration</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520130/extras/800754685da079e87ae91a4cd029ae7b.avif?t=1713085008\" /></span><br><br>You will be able to explore a whole continent full of unique cities with different cultures and religions! Each faction has its own philosophy, views on history and goals!<br><br>Meet various lively (and not so lively) characters and complete their assignments. Some of them may even join your party!<br><br><strong>Wishlist now</strong><br>If you like the game, the best thing you can do to support us is to add this game to your wishlist. It is a great motivation for our team to keep on working.",
